$ The Send More Money Problem
$
$ solve the equation
$    S E N D
$  + M O R E
$  ----------
$  M O N E Y

language ESSENCE' 1.0
letting D1 be domain int(0..9)
letting D2 be domain int(1..9)
find m : matrix indexed by [D1] of D2

such that 

forAll i : int(10..1) .
   m[i] > 0
,

$ Bound this regression so its complete solution set stays small.
m[0]<=2, m[9]<=2,
(forAll i : int(1..8) . m[i]=1)
